{"text":"Same thing, oh we just can't get the right performance out of our people, maybe it's you, right? It's not a generation, it's not them. They're not difficult or hard to understand. They're human beings like the rest of us trying to find their way, trying to work in a place where they feel that someone cares about them as a human being. By the way, that's what we all want. In other words, it's not even generational. It's all of us. This is the practice of empathy. That if we're struggling to communicate to someone, if it's struggling to help someone be at their natural best, I'm tired of people saying to me, how do I get the best out of my people? Really, that's what you want? They're like a towel, you just wring them. How can I get the most out of them? No, how do I help my people be at their natural best? Right, we're not asking these questions. We are not practicing empathy. We have to start by practicing empathy and relate to what they may be going through and it will profoundly change the decisions we make. It will profoundly change the way we see the world.","words":[{"text":"Same","start":0.96,"end":1.44},{"text":"thing","start":1.44,"end":1.92,"punct":","},{"text":"oh","start":2.54,"end":2.56},{"text":"we","start":2.56,"end":2.68},{"text":"just","start":2.68,"end":2.82},{"text":"can't","start":2.82,"end":3.08},{"text":"get","start":3.08,"end":3.2},{"text":"the","start":3.2,"end":3.28},{"text":"right","start":3.28,"end":4.24},{"text":"performance","start":4.24,"end":4.9},{"text":"out","start":4.9,"end":5.1},{"text":"of","start":5.1,"end":5.18},{"text":"our","start":5.18,"end":5.26},{"text":"people","start":5.26,"end":5.56,"punct":","},{"text":"maybe","start":5.74,"end":5.94},{"text":"it's","start":5.94,"end":6.26},{"text":"you","start":6.26,"end":6.64,"punct":","},{"text":"right","start":7.84,"end":8.12,"punct":"?"},{"text":"It's","start":8.46,"end":8.62},{"text":"not","start":8.62,"end":8.8},{"text":"a","start":8.8,"end":8.92},{"text":"generation","st